  "notes": "Each atoll has one school (Tialeniu, Matiti, Matauala) teaching ECE to Year 13. The curriculum framework groups early primary (Years 1–3), primary (Years 4–8) and secondary (Years 9–11, ending with Year 11 exams); the senior secondary programme (Year 12 from 2008, Year 13 from 2009) offers transition and USP Foundation courses."
